Type: Package
Package: parallel.lsm
Title: Parallel Processing Wrappers for `landscapemetrics` Functions
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Tanner", "Hammond", , "idonutunderstand@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides wrapper functions for `landscapemetrics` that process data in parallel. `parallel.lsm` wrappers stay close to the original format of `landscapemetrics` functions, allowing users to easily transition to parallel processing with minimal changes to their code.
